<section class="section about-intro"><div class="about-wrap about-grid"><div class="about-photo"><img src={pathTo('/images/clinic.webp')} alt="Medical clinic building with glass-fronted entrance" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="750" /></div><div class="about-copy"><h2>Welcome to the<br/>OCA Medical Group</h2><p>Goodlife Physical Medicine delivers integrated, patient-focused care through a team of specialists in chiropractic, pain management, physical medicine, and conventional medicine. Using an integrative approach, the team combines traditional medical care with complementary therapies to create customized treatment plans.</p><p>As a multidisciplinary one-stop clinic, Goodlife offers on-site diagnostic imaging, including digital X-rays, ultrasound, and MRI, allowing for fast and accurate diagnoses. The focus is on long-term relief and overall wellness without relying on addictive medications, unnecessary surgery, or invasive procedures.</p><a href={pathTo('/about/')} class="button-primary button-roman">Read More About Us</a></div></div></section>
